 "text": "9/29/26, 10:19 AM\nYou can execute the Rescheduling of Disconnection/Reconnection Orders report, which allows you to reschedule one or several\n\ndisconnection or reconnection orders.\n\nActivities\n\n1. Access the corresponding screen by way of the SAP Easy Access menu (|/+UtilitiesIndustry >\u00bb CustomerService\nProcessExecution \u00bb Disconnection/Reconnection \u00bb Reschedule Disconnection Orders 9) ).\n\n2. Specify the selection criteria for the orders you wish to reschedule.\n\n3. Choose the Execute button to reschedule the selected orders right away, or choose the Schedule Job button to specify a\n\ndate and time.\n\nFor more information on the selection criteria, refer to the corresponding report documentation, which you can access from the\n\nselection screen.\n\nNote that is is not possible to change either of the the disconnection dates (agreed date or planned date) if a service order has\n\nalready been generated.\n",
